WEBVTT

00:00:00.753 --> 00:00:03.000
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1, a

00:00:03.923 --> 00:00:05.639
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> What are you going to <b>wear</b> tonight?

00:00:07.219 --> 00:00:07.904
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> b

00:00:08.930 --> 00:00:09.971
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Where</b> are you from?

00:00:10.394 --> 00:00:11.632
<v><b>B:</b></v> I’m from Warsaw

00:00:13.665 --> 00:00:15.976
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2, a

00:00:17.036 --> 00:00:18.578
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I don’t <b>know</b> what to do.

00:00:19.779 --> 00:00:20.517
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> b

00:00:21.343 --> 00:00:23.465
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> There’s <b>no</b> milk in the fridge!

00:00:25.413 --> 00:00:27.690
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3, a

00:00:28.656 --> 00:00:30.267
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Hi. Nice to <b>meet</b> you.

00:00:31.654 --> 00:00:32.322
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> b

00:00:33.184 --> 00:00:35.559
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Do you want <b>meat</b> or fish?

00:00:37.462 --> 00:00:39.789
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4, a

00:00:40.719 --> 00:00:43.923
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> The maximum <b>weight</b> for hand luggage is ten kilos.

00:00:45.305 --> 00:00:45.993
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> b

00:00:46.809 --> 00:00:49.628
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I’m coming! <b>Wait</b> for me!

00:00:51.647 --> 00:00:54.480
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5, a

00:00:55.464 --> 00:00:56.855
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Please <b>write</b> soon.

00:00:58.342 --> 00:00:59.043
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> b

00:00:59.986 --> 00:01:01.965
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Is it on the left or on the <b>right</b>?

00:01:03.925 --> 00:01:06.310
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6, a

00:01:07.375 --> 00:01:09.313
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> There’s only <b>one</b> ticket left.

00:01:10.914 --> 00:01:11.604
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> b

00:01:12.532 --> 00:01:14.846
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> Brazil <b>won</b> the match five–one.

00:01:16.922 --> 00:01:19.262
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7, a

00:01:20.373 --> 00:01:21.894
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> I can’t <b>see</b> the board!

00:01:23.464 --> 00:01:24.091
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> b

00:01:25.028 --> 00:01:26.775
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> I love swimming in the <b>sea</b>.

00:01:28.978 --> 00:01:31.249
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8, a

00:01:32.211 --> 00:01:34.250
<v><b>Speaker 1:</b></v> Have you ever read <i>War and Peace</i>?

00:01:35.767 --> 00:01:36.446
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> b

00:01:37.371 --> 00:01:39.860
<v><b>Speaker 2:</b></v> It was cold, so she <b>wore</b> a coat.